1
00:01:30,330 --> 00:01:35,009
[The Heir]

2
00:01:35,440 --> 00:01:37,940
[Episod 36]

3
00:01:39,229 --> 00:01:40,039
Hua,

4
00:01:40,680 --> 00:01:42,610
akhirnya awak dapat menerimanya.

5
00:01:43,280 --> 00:01:46,610
Walaupun kali ini awak bukan berkahwin
sebagai isteri sah,

6
00:01:46,759 --> 00:01:49,280
hantaran kahwin daripada keluarga kita

7
00:01:49,280 --> 00:01:50,610
tak kurang sedikit pun.

8
00:01:50,950 --> 00:01:53,759
Nanti apabila awak keluar
dengan barang-barang ini,

9
00:01:53,759 --> 00:01:55,360
orang lain pun akan iri hati.

10
00:01:57,430 --> 00:01:58,560
Benarlah kata mak.

11
00:01:59,000 --> 00:02:01,070
Dulu Hua yang tak matang

12
00:02:01,230 --> 00:02:02,400
dan asyik mengamuk.

13
00:02:02,920 --> 00:02:04,950
Hari ini Hua cuma nak tengok

14
00:02:04,950 --> 00:02:06,870
hantaran kahwin ini bersama mak
dengan baik-baik.

15
00:02:06,870 --> 00:02:09,729
Jangan mensia-siakan niat baik mak
dan abang long.

16
00:02:12,630 --> 00:02:14,430
Jom, mak bawa awak pergi tengok.

17
00:02:17,079 --> 00:02:18,360
Mari, Hua, masuklah.

18
00:02:22,840 --> 00:02:23,770
Awak tengoklah.

19
00:02:24,560 --> 00:02:26,360
Semua ini hantaran kahwin awak.

20
00:02:28,190 --> 00:02:29,450
Kain sutera dan satin.

21
00:02:34,470 --> 00:02:35,600
Selimut pengantin.

22
00:02:36,000 --> 00:02:36,930
Di sini ada lagi.

23
00:02:40,400 --> 00:02:42,000
Barang kemas dan perhiasan.

24
00:02:42,350 --> 00:02:43,420
Semuanya ada.

25
00:02:51,560 --> 00:02:53,490
Nanjing berjarak jauh dari rumah.

26
00:02:54,000 --> 00:02:55,430
Ayah, mak dan abang-abang

27
00:02:55,430 --> 00:02:57,280
tak dapat menjaga awak sepanjang masa,

28
00:02:57,280 --> 00:03:01,710
jadi kami hanya boleh berusaha lebih
dalam penyediaan hantaran kahwin ini.

29
00:03:02,840 --> 00:03:04,680
Kami sama sekali tak boleh
biarkan awak dilayan dengan tak adil

30
00:03:04,680 --> 00:03:05,960
dalam keluarga suami.

31
00:03:06,080 --> 00:03:06,840
Mak,

32
00:03:07,520 --> 00:03:08,520
susah payah kamu

33
00:03:08,630 --> 00:03:11,290
sediakan begitu banyak barang baik
untuk saya.

34
00:03:12,430 --> 00:03:15,650
Tetapi bak kata orang,
pakaian lama lebih selesa dipakai.

35
00:03:15,650 --> 00:03:18,680
Boleh tak saya bawa sekali semua pakaian

36
00:03:18,800 --> 00:03:20,400
yang saya pakai sebelum ini?

37
00:03:20,910 --> 00:03:22,750
Itu semua pakaian lama.

38
00:03:23,280 --> 00:03:24,810
Buat apa awak nak bawa lagi?

39
00:03:28,360 --> 00:03:30,120
Sebab banyak pakaian itu

40
00:03:31,000 --> 00:03:32,630
mak yang buat untuk saya.

41
00:03:33,800 --> 00:03:35,329
Saya ingin bawanya bersama

42
00:03:35,710 --> 00:03:37,030
sebagai kenangan.

43
00:03:45,680 --> 00:03:47,410
Mak berterima kasih kepada Hua

44
00:03:48,000 --> 00:03:49,530
kerana masih fikirkan mak.

45
00:03:50,910 --> 00:03:51,590
Baiklah.

46
00:03:52,250 --> 00:03:53,980
Mak pergi sediakan untuk awak.

47
00:03:54,800 --> 00:03:56,460
Awak tengok-tengoklah lagi.

48
00:04:14,520 --> 00:04:15,080
Mak.

49
00:04:16,160 --> 00:04:17,490
Mak pergi buat apa tadi?

50
00:04:18,040 --> 00:04:18,680
Itu...

51
00:04:19,390 --> 00:04:20,720
Hua sudah menerimanya.

52
00:04:20,870 --> 00:04:22,750
Dia kata nak tengok hantaran kahwin.

53
00:04:22,750 --> 00:04:25,920
Jadi, mak bawa dia ke gudang untuk tengok.

54
00:04:26,480 --> 00:04:27,740
Dia agak berpuas hati.

55
00:04:28,800 --> 00:04:29,390
Itu...

56
00:04:29,390 --> 00:04:32,320
Mak pergi tolong dia kemaskan
beberapa barang lagi.

57
00:05:14,680 --> 00:05:16,140
Kenapa abang long datang?

58
00:05:18,510 --> 00:05:19,370
Tiada apa-apa.

59
00:05:20,510 --> 00:05:22,510
Mak kata awak sedang tengok
hantaran kahwin di sini,

60
00:05:22,510 --> 00:05:23,970
jadi abang datang tengok.

61
00:05:24,510 --> 00:05:26,360
Jika ada apa-apa yang kurang,

62
00:05:27,730 --> 00:05:29,160
abang boleh segera sediakan untuk awak.

63
00:05:29,160 --> 00:05:30,420
Tiada apa yang kurang.

64
00:05:31,190 --> 00:05:32,240
Apa pun,

65
00:05:32,750 --> 00:05:34,480
saya tetap ahli keluarga Tian.

66
00:05:35,510 --> 00:05:37,970
Apa yang patut saya buat
untuk keluarga Tian

67
00:05:38,040 --> 00:05:39,570
akan saya buat dengan baik.

68
00:05:54,510 --> 00:05:55,950
Setelah cuba banyak pakaian,

69
00:05:55,950 --> 00:05:57,070
saya pun sudah penat.

70
00:05:57,070 --> 00:05:59,010
Saya nak pergi berehat di kedai teh.

71
00:05:59,010 --> 00:06:00,570
Cik, puan sudah berpesan,

72
00:06:00,600 --> 00:06:02,190
cik harus terus pulang
selepas selesai cuba pakaian.

73
00:06:02,190 --> 00:06:03,120
Bisinglah.

74
00:06:03,390 --> 00:06:04,540
Saya nak pergi minum teh sekejap pun

75
00:06:04,540 --> 00:06:06,340
perlu minta izin daripada kamu?

76
00:06:06,950 --> 00:06:08,110
Kamu jaga saja di sini.

77
00:06:08,110 --> 00:06:09,110
Jangan ikut saya.

78
00:06:16,430 --> 00:06:17,240
Zhen.

79
00:06:17,430 --> 00:06:18,890
Memang benar tekaan awak.

80
00:06:18,920 --> 00:06:21,600
Dakwat seludupan itu disembunyikan
dalam hantaran kahwin.

81
00:06:21,600 --> 00:06:23,000
Awak sudah lihat dengan jelas?

82
00:06:23,000 --> 00:06:24,730
Berapa banyak dakwat yang ada?

83
00:06:26,160 --> 00:06:28,760
Jika setiap kotak
ada berpuluh-puluh batang,

84
00:06:29,190 --> 00:06:31,680
jumlahnya mungkin ada beribu-ribu batang.

85
00:06:31,680 --> 00:06:32,880
Beribu-ribu batang?

86
00:06:35,480 --> 00:06:37,680
Ini kesalahan yang boleh dihukum pancung.

87
00:06:37,680 --> 00:06:39,120
Tak sangka Tian Benchang

88
00:06:39,390 --> 00:06:41,430
sanggup mempertaruhkan nyawa
untuk menjadi pegawai.

89
00:06:41,430 --> 00:06:42,159
Zhen.

90
00:06:42,870 --> 00:06:43,920
Keadaan sudah jadi begini,

91
00:06:43,920 --> 00:06:45,850
saya pun tiada apa-apa
untuk ditakutkan lagi.

92
00:06:45,850 --> 00:06:47,680
Apa kata kita terus pergi
ke pejabat kerajaan

93
00:06:47,680 --> 00:06:49,390
dan melaporkan perkara ini
kepada tuan pentadbir?

94
00:06:49,390 --> 00:06:50,190
Tak boleh.

95
00:06:50,310 --> 00:06:51,430
Pejabat kerajaan

96
00:06:51,600 --> 00:06:53,800
penuh dengan pengintip Tian Benchang.

97
00:06:53,830 --> 00:06:55,470
Jika kita terburu-buru membuat laporan,

98
00:06:55,470 --> 00:06:57,310
sebelum sempat kita berjumpa
dengan tuan pentadbir,

99
00:06:57,310 --> 00:06:59,180
Tian Benchang akan mendapat berita

100
00:06:59,180 --> 00:07:01,380
dan memindahkan dakwat seludupan itu.

101
00:07:01,750 --> 00:07:03,610
Jika mahu mencari kesalahannya,

102
00:07:03,830 --> 00:07:06,490
kita mesti menangkapnya
bersama barang bukti.

103
00:07:06,780 --> 00:07:08,920
Tetapi, dia sentiasa berfikiran teliti.

104
00:07:08,920 --> 00:07:11,090
Macam mana kita boleh menipunya?

105
00:07:13,950 --> 00:07:14,680
Hua.

106
00:07:15,560 --> 00:07:17,190
Esok semasa awak berkahwin,

107
00:07:17,240 --> 00:07:20,190
Tian Benchang pasti akan keluar
dari kota untuk menghantar awak, kan?

108
00:07:20,190 --> 00:07:21,160
Sudah tentu.

109
00:07:22,720 --> 00:07:24,450
Bentuk badan kita hampir sama.

110
00:07:24,720 --> 00:07:27,600
Esok, saya akan naik tandu pengantin
bagi pihak awak.

111
00:07:27,600 --> 00:07:29,270
Zhen, ini terlalu berbahaya.

112
00:07:29,270 --> 00:07:30,480
Saya tak boleh biarkan awak
ambil risiko ini.

113
00:07:30,480 --> 00:07:32,940
Hua, saya buat begini
bukan saja untuk awak,

114
00:07:33,159 --> 00:07:35,620
tetapi juga untuk diri saya
dan keluarga Li.

115
00:07:37,000 --> 00:07:38,040
Esok,

116
00:07:38,510 --> 00:07:40,800
apabila tandu pengantin sampai
ke Jalan Empat Harta,

117
00:07:40,800 --> 00:07:42,440
saya akan menghentikan tandu itu.

118
00:07:42,440 --> 00:07:44,740
Apabila tiba masanya, Xiao Qi
dan Gou Er akan membantu saya

119
00:07:44,740 --> 00:07:46,640
mendedahkan dakwat seludupan
yang disembunyikan dalam hantaran kahwin

120
00:07:46,640 --> 00:07:47,670
kepada orang ramai.

121
00:07:47,670 --> 00:07:49,360
Pada masa itu, dia akan ditangkap
bersama barang bukti.

122
00:07:49,360 --> 00:07:51,270
Walau selicik mana pun Tian Benchang,

123
00:07:51,270 --> 00:07:53,070
dia takkan mampu berdalih lagi.

124
00:07:54,159 --> 00:07:55,870
Perkahwinan awak ini pula

125
00:07:56,240 --> 00:07:57,370
melibatkan jenayah Tian Benchang

126
00:07:57,370 --> 00:07:58,870
yang menyeludup dakwat
dan membeli jawatan rasmi,

127
00:07:58,870 --> 00:08:00,530
sudah tentu ia akan terbatal.

128
00:08:01,320 --> 00:08:03,120
Hua, kali ini,

129
00:08:04,310 --> 00:08:05,970
awak mesti dengar cakap saya.

130
00:08:12,310 --> 00:08:13,750
Hua, kita ikut jalan berasingan.

131
00:08:13,750 --> 00:08:14,890
Saya ikut pintu belakang.

132
00:08:14,890 --> 00:08:15,910
Awak cepat balik ke rumah

133
00:08:15,910 --> 00:08:17,840
untuk mengelakkan syak wasangka.

134
00:08:18,000 --> 00:08:18,930
Cepatlah pergi.

135
00:08:34,600 --> 00:08:36,480
Dasar pengkhianat.

136
00:08:37,549 --> 00:08:38,360
Abang.

137
00:08:38,909 --> 00:08:40,030
Keadaan sudah jadi begini,

138
00:08:40,030 --> 00:08:41,720
dakwat itu masih akan diangkut
atau tak esok?

139
00:08:41,720 --> 00:08:42,630
Mestilah.

140
00:08:43,720 --> 00:08:44,790
Jika tak keluar dari kota esok,

141
00:08:44,790 --> 00:08:46,520
kita akan terlepas laluan air.

142
00:08:46,720 --> 00:08:48,780
Jika masa penghantaran tertangguh,

143
00:08:48,960 --> 00:08:51,090
wang ini pun tak dapat dikutip semula.

144
00:08:53,630 --> 00:08:55,360
Memandangkan Li Zhen mahu bermain helah

145
00:08:55,360 --> 00:08:57,320
menggantikan pengantin
untuk mendapatkan bukti,

146
00:08:57,320 --> 00:08:58,000
baiklah.

147
00:08:59,600 --> 00:09:01,080
Saya akan buat dia tahu

148
00:09:01,910 --> 00:09:04,040
apa ertinya sangka diri sendiri bijak

149
00:09:04,720 --> 00:09:06,320
dan cari nahas sendiri.

150
00:09:07,930 --> 00:09:16,500
[Halaman Makmur]

151
00:09:18,870 --> 00:09:21,000
Kamu semua pergi ke sana. Mari.

152
00:09:24,270 --> 00:09:25,200
Sini.

153
00:09:28,480 --> 00:09:29,810
Pukul berapa sekarang?

154
00:09:30,000 --> 00:09:31,400
Sidah lepas pukul 7 pagi.

155
00:09:34,630 --> 00:09:37,870
Awak pergi tengok ayah, mak dan abang long

156
00:09:38,380 --> 00:09:39,840
sudah bersiap atau belum.

157
00:09:40,180 --> 00:09:40,700
Baik.

158
00:10:07,720 --> 00:10:08,360
Hua.

159
00:10:08,720 --> 00:10:09,510
Hua.

160
00:10:10,840 --> 00:10:11,670
Ini saya.

161
00:10:14,870 --> 00:10:16,750
Zhen, saya risau akan awak.

162
00:10:16,750 --> 00:10:17,440
Saya tertanya-tanya

163
00:10:17,440 --> 00:10:19,170
kenapa awak belum sampai lagi.

164
00:10:19,240 --> 00:10:20,340
Hua, awak jangan risau.

165
00:10:20,340 --> 00:10:21,640
Semuanya akan berjalan mengikut rancangan.

166
00:10:21,640 --> 00:10:22,440
Jangan risau.

167
00:10:22,670 --> 00:10:24,440
Kawal halaman ini dengan ketat.

168
00:10:24,440 --> 00:10:25,630
Jangan benarkan sesiapa pun
keluar masuk sesuka hati.

169
00:10:25,630 --> 00:10:27,080
Zhen, awak pergi sembunyi.

170
00:10:27,080 --> 00:10:28,950
Sembunyi di belakang tabir pemisah,
cepat pergi.

171
00:10:28,950 --> 00:10:29,560
Baik.

172
00:10:42,030 --> 00:10:43,490
Kenapa abang long datang?

173
00:10:43,630 --> 00:10:44,480
Geledah!

174
00:10:45,790 --> 00:10:47,520
Siapa antara kamu yang berani?

175
00:10:48,840 --> 00:10:51,640
Tian Benchang, apa sebenarnya
yang awak nak buat?

176
00:10:51,910 --> 00:10:53,080
Lepaskan saya!

177
00:10:53,550 --> 00:10:54,390
Lepaskan!

178
00:10:54,840 --> 00:10:55,510
- Zhen!
Hua!

179
00:10:55,550 --> 00:10:57,600
Lepaskan dia!

180
00:10:57,630 --> 00:10:58,670
- Zhen.
- Lepaskan!

181
00:10:58,670 --> 00:11:01,270
Awak dan Hua benar-benar rapat
bagai adik-beradik.

182
00:11:01,270 --> 00:11:02,000
Sayangnya,

183
00:11:02,440 --> 00:11:03,670
awak tersilap satu langkah,

184
00:11:03,670 --> 00:11:05,800
akhirnya tetap bukan tandingan saya.

185
00:11:06,150 --> 00:11:07,960
Tian Benchang, saya sudah tahu semua

186
00:11:07,960 --> 00:11:08,780
tentang awak mengorbankan adik
demi kemuliaan

187
00:11:08,780 --> 00:11:09,600
dan menyeludup dakwat
untuk mengaut keuntungan.

188
00:11:09,600 --> 00:11:11,080
Jangan terus melakukan kesilapan lagi!

189
00:11:11,080 --> 00:11:12,840
Heret dia keluar, naikkan dia ke tandu.

190
00:11:12,840 --> 00:11:13,320
Jangan sentuh saya!

191
00:11:13,320 --> 00:11:13,750
Hua.

192
00:11:13,840 --> 00:11:14,480
Hua!

193
00:11:14,630 --> 00:11:15,320
Zhen!

194
00:11:15,550 --> 00:11:16,150
Zhen!

195
00:11:16,150 --> 00:11:16,720
Hua!

196
00:11:16,720 --> 00:11:17,390
Zhen!

197
00:11:17,390 --> 00:11:17,960
Hua!

198
00:11:17,960 --> 00:11:18,720
Lepaskan saya!

199
00:11:18,720 --> 00:11:20,480
Lepaskan saya! Zhen!

200
00:11:20,510 --> 00:11:22,200
Lepaskan saya!

201
00:11:22,550 --> 00:11:23,410
Lepaskan saya!

202
00:11:25,170 --> 00:11:26,050
Lepaskan saya!

203
00:11:26,080 --> 00:11:27,000
Tian Benchang!

204
00:11:27,120 --> 00:11:28,570
Awak mengorbankan adik demi kemuliaan.

205
00:11:28,570 --> 00:11:29,630
Awak tak tahu malu!

206
00:11:29,630 --> 00:11:30,390
Zhen.

207
00:11:30,920 --> 00:11:32,850
Tunggu saya hantar Hua naik tandu,

208
00:11:33,080 --> 00:11:35,280
baru saya balik berurusan dengan awak.

209
00:11:35,870 --> 00:11:36,910
Ikat dia.

210
00:11:36,910 --> 00:11:37,440
Baik!

211
00:11:37,960 --> 00:11:39,630
Lepaskan saya!

212
00:11:40,720 --> 00:11:41,630
Lepaskan!

213
00:11:42,360 --> 00:11:43,270
Lepaskan!

214
00:11:48,270 --> 00:11:49,000
Hua.

215
00:11:49,480 --> 00:11:51,790
Jika awak betul-betul mengambil berat
tentang keselamatan Zhen,

216
00:11:51,790 --> 00:11:54,050
lebih baik awak berkahwin dengan patuh.

217
00:11:54,480 --> 00:11:57,940
Jika tak, awak sendiri yang akan
menghantarnya ke jalan maut.

218
00:12:00,120 --> 00:12:01,390
Awasi Hua baik-baik.

219
00:12:01,720 --> 00:12:02,240
Baik.

220
00:12:04,250 --> 00:12:06,380
Pihak Pegawai Zhang sudah diuruskan?

221
00:12:06,390 --> 00:12:07,920
Semuanya sudah diuruskan.

222
00:12:07,960 --> 00:12:09,160
Abang, jangan risau.

223
00:12:09,510 --> 00:12:12,770
Saya akan memastikan Hua keluar
dari kota dengan selamat.

224
00:12:15,910 --> 00:12:17,320
Keluar dan kawal halaman.

225
00:12:17,320 --> 00:12:18,120
Tanpa arahan saya,

226
00:12:18,120 --> 00:12:19,790
jangan benarkan sesiapa pun masuk.

227
00:12:19,790 --> 00:12:20,510
Baik.

228
00:12:52,790 --> 00:12:53,870
Tian Benchang.

229
00:12:54,300 --> 00:12:56,030
Awak mengurung rakyat secara tak sah,

230
00:12:56,030 --> 00:12:57,720
tak takut ada orang membuat laporan
kepada pihak pejabat kerajaan

231
00:12:57,720 --> 00:12:59,860
dan membawa tentera datang menghukum awak?

232
00:12:59,860 --> 00:13:02,120
Awak yang menceroboh masuk
ke dalam Kediaman Tian,

233
00:13:02,120 --> 00:13:04,050
mengganggu perkahwinan adik saya

234
00:13:04,520 --> 00:13:06,750
dan mengacau ketenteraman terlebih dahulu.

235
00:13:06,750 --> 00:13:09,080
Biarpun kita berdepan di mahkamah nanti,

236
00:13:09,080 --> 00:13:10,810
saya tetap di pihak yang benar.

237
00:13:12,480 --> 00:13:13,320
Lagipun,

238
00:13:14,790 --> 00:13:16,250
rakan-rakan subahat awak

239
00:13:16,510 --> 00:13:17,870
semua sedang menunggu
untuk menahan tandu pengantin

240
00:13:17,870 --> 00:13:19,390
di Jalan Empat Harta sekarang, bukan?

241
00:13:19,390 --> 00:13:21,190
Siapa yang akan pedulikan awak?

